# Run the demo first. In VS Code with REST Client: send login, then the dashboard request.
@base = http://localhost:5029

### Service health
GET {{base}}/health

### Sign in with fictional classroom credentials
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/officerauth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email":"officer@agri.test", "password":"FieldDemo-26" }

### Read this account's dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/officerdashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
